      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">This slurry for forming a negative electrode</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">was coated on a copper foil having a thickness of 10  ⁇ m as a negative electrode current collector, and the resulting coated membrane was dried, followed by pressing, to produce a negative electrode having a negative electrode active material layer.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0403">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">a lead tab</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">was welded to each of the positive electrode and negative electrode. Then, the positive electrode, a separator and the negative electrode were stacked in this order to produce a stacked body.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0407">
