      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the stacked body</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">was impregnated with an electrolyte, and enclosed in an aluminum laminated film pack. Here, 1 M LiPF6-ethylene carbonate/ethyl methyl carbonate (mass ratio: 3/7) was used as the electrolyte.</span>
