      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the stacked body</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">was impregnated with an electrolyte, and enclosed in an aluminum laminated film pack. Here, 1 M LiPF 6 -ethylene carbonate/ethyl methyl carbonate (mass ratio: 3/7) was used as the electrolyte.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="0463">
      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">a vacuum sealer</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">the inside of the pack was made vacuum and the pack was tentatively sealed, and, using a heat press machine, the stacked body together with the pack was subjected to a heat pressing, thereby bonding the electrode and the separator and sealing the pack.</span>
